# Binary/image files explicitly allowed in this repo.
#
# One glob pattern per line, matched against repo-relative paths by
# meta/scripts/check_no_binaries.sh using bash `case` globbing (so `*` DOES
# cross `/`). Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# The default rule stands: binaries belong in ../testsAndMisc_binaries/, not
# here. The only exception is files a build genuinely cannot run without.
# Every pattern below must also have a matching `!` override at the end of
# .gitignore, or git will silently drop the file.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# billsplit (Flutter) — platform launcher icons and launch images.
# These are build inputs: `flutter build` for android/ios/macos/windows fails
# without them, so they cannot be symlinked out to a sibling directory without
# breaking a fresh clone. Patterns are globs (not literal paths) so they keep
# working when the icon set is regenerated by the app-icon generator.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
billsplit/assets/icon/*.svg
billsplit/assets/icon/*.png
billsplit/android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-*/ic_launcher.png
billsplit/android/app/src/main/res/drawable-*/ic_launcher_foreground.png
billsplit/android/app/src/main/res/drawable-*/ic_launcher_monochrome.png
billsplit/ios/Runner/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/*.png
billsplit/ios/Runner/Assets.xcassets/LaunchImage.imageset/*.png
billsplit/macos/Runner/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/*.png
billsplit/windows/runner/resources/app_icon.ico
